---
title: Streaks · how one habit's day resolves
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> open: an active habit's day
  open --> done: checked off at 100 percent
  open --> missed: day ends incomplete
  missed --> done: backfilled the next day
  missed --> frozen: freeze spent the next day
  missed --> broken: no backfill · no freeze
  broken --> restored: two clean days within 48 hours · once a month
  broken --> reset: otherwise
  state "Streak continues" as done
  state "Covered by a freeze" as frozen
  state "Streak broken" as broken
  state "Earn-Back" as restored
  state "Starts over at 0" as reset
  done --> [*]
  frozen --> [*]
  class done backend
  class frozen local
  class broken external
  class restored gate
  class reset neutral
